WEBVTT

00:00:34.228 --> 00:00:41.983
Pix: I'm Pix. I have zero patience and a thumb that opens Instagram without asking me. So I tested Stay like it owed me money.

00:00:44.163 --> 00:00:48.203
Pix: Okay so, this is Stay? Prove you're not just another chatbot. Go.

00:00:49.145 --> 00:00:56.445
Stay: I’m the Stay assistant built to help you start tasks and stay focused. Ask me anything you need help with.

00:00:58.778 --> 00:01:02.911
Pix: Meh. Why would I use you and not just ask the big AI app? Be honest.

00:01:03.471 --> 00:01:22.081
Stay: A clock app starts a timer, and a general voice assistant will talk about anything. I'm for the moment you're stuck. Tell me what you're avoiding and I give you one tiny first step, start the clock with you, and wait through your pauses. When time's up I check in, and I remember what helped.

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:29.336
Pix: I have been on Instagram for two hours and I don't even remember what I looked at.

00:01:30.742 --> 00:01:38.173
Stay: That’s a lot of scrolling. Let’s close Instagram and spend five minutes writing down one thing you need to do next.

00:01:40.536 --> 00:01:43.369
Pix: Don't give me a lecture. Just tell me what to do right now.

00:01:44.852 --> 00:01:50.790
Stay: Close Instagram now, then open a new note and write the single task you want to start.

00:01:52.661 --> 00:01:56.423
Pix: Explain how to build a study schedule for finals. Like all of it.

00:01:59.126 --> 00:02:02.377
Pix: Wait wait, stop. Too long. Just give me the first block.

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:09.640
Stay: Start by listing each subject and the total hours you have until the finals. Divide those hours into blocks, giving harder topics more time. Assign each block a specific date and keep the schedule visible. Want a more detailed step‑by‑step? Pick one subject, write a 30‑minute focus block, set a timer.

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:15.177
Pix: It stopped the second I talked over it. I hate how well that worked.

00:02:16.728 --> 00:02:18.771
Pix: Remember that I scroll when I'm anxious.

00:02:19.795 --> 00:02:22.145
Stay: Got it, I will remember.

00:02:24.133 --> 00:02:25.619
Pix: What do you remember about me?

00:02:26.511 --> 00:02:29.581
Stay: I am saving that you scroll when anxious.

00:02:32.003 --> 00:02:33.118
Pix: Show my report.

00:02:33.893 --> 00:02:34.923
Stay: Done.

00:03:10.645 --> 00:03:11.713
Pix: Open settings.

00:03:12.811 --> 00:03:13.841
Stay: Done.

00:03:20.331 --> 00:03:21.678
Pix: Set a two minute timer.

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:23.640
Stay: Done.

00:03:25.942 --> 00:03:28.032
Pix: Park it: text my landlord tonight.

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:30.160
Stay: Parked.

00:03:31.610 --> 00:03:35.743
Pix: It's not magic. It's a voice that helps me start. Fine. I'm staying.
